type: txt
help: Set the maximum allowed time to wait for data during content
			inspection
val_help: u32:1-65535; The timeout value specified in milliseconds
syntax:expression: exec "${vyos_libexec_dir}/validate-value  --exec \"${vyos_validators_dir}/numeric --range 1-65535\"  --value \'$VAR(@)\'"; "The timeout value must be in range 1 to 65535 milliseconds"
